{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"017b3a69daf7d3e89bf9fda829b7c64bd0a99606161fc7495aa6972c9b8a2997","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP fsck tool and library facade","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/fsck.py","src/rebar/_lib_reads.py","src/rebar/_mcp_reads.py","src/rebar/_mcp_models.py","src/rebar/schemas/fsck.schema.json","rebar.fsck()","fsck_report()","FsckOut","STATUS_FORK_RESOLVED"],"problem_keywords":["fsck","diagnostic tool","exit code","error handling","tool output","structured result"],"propositions":["The MCP fsck tool converts a completed diagnostic run (with findings) into a command_failed error object rather than returning a structured result, making findings inaccessible to callers.","The library facade in _lib_reads.py raises RebarError on any non-zero fsck exit code, treating the exit-1-on-findings convention (shared with git fsck and fsck(8)) as a failed call rather than a completed run.","The CLI fsck already produces structured --output=json output but the library wrapper calls it in text mode and discards the structure into an exception message.","The fsck and fsck-recover commands have incompatible exit-code vocabularies and output shapes but are routed through the same library reader with a single exit-code contract, causing recover's mode-1 (completed recovery) to be misread as a scan failure.","Self-resolved STATUS_FORK_RESOLVED records are permanently present in the store (no clear/prune/TTL path exists) and currently counted toward the failure exit, making fsck permanently fail by design on stores with prior cross-clone races.","After code review, FsckOut was added to _mcp_models.py but not re-exported in mcp_server.py's import block or __all__, making the back-compat import path unavailable for new callers despite being the documented contract for all peer _Out models."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787908925058802001,"uuid":"814c49ea-b318-4f84-93f1-334f6f5a5116"}